OL,3,GNEWSABid to allow unaccompanied 12 to
OL,4,A15-year-olds into pubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospitality company is seeking
OL,7,Flicensing permission to allow children
OL,8,Fas young as 12 to enter some Edinburgh
OL,9,Fpubs and restaurants without an adult.
OL,11,FSignature Pubs Limited has asked the
OL,12,Fcouncil to approve plans that would let
OL,13,Fteenagers enter the premises alone or
OL,14,Fin groups of up to six to buy a meal,
OL,15,Fsnack or soft drink.
OL,17,FIf granted, they would be served at
OL,18,FMcClarens on the Corner in Morningside,
OL,19,FCold Town House in Grassmarket and The
OL,20,FFountain on Dundee Street.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
